# Database client versions, recorded but not mise managed.
#
# Every measurement in ADR 0001 cites a SQLite version, and a measurement
# nobody can reproduce is a number nobody should trust. Postgres is here for
# the day the bridge has a real target.
#
# These live apart from .tool-versions because mise cannot resolve psql, and
# naming an unresolvable tool there makes mise warn on every command in this
# directory.
#
# CI does not run either of these yet. They are pinned so that when it does,
# the version is decided rather than discovered.

sqlite3 3.53.4
psql    18.6
